{"version":1,"content":"<p>一組據稱是摩託羅拉下一代摺疊屏手機Razr Flex的實拍圖在網上流傳。繼此前Reddit平台出現一張泄露照片後，新一批圖片從多個角度展示了這款設備，包括其完全展開和部分摺疊時的狀態。這些照片進一步支持了外界的一種判斷：寬屏設計可能正在成為摺疊屏手機的主流形態。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587150.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T19:02:27.037977+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T18:36:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T18:55:40.523112+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T18:55:40.523112+00:00","content_hash":"6146328f17986e8e4a2f8e2d3eaf41bccfb8eb4c1a0bfe715077b94196b46dee","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}